  "Id": 2443,
  "Title": "Video: Islam and Popular Culture",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Professor Jonas Otterbeck talks about his research on popular culture and Islam",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass64B7B17185504700B5F35CFE96F82D49\"><p><br></p><p>\u200bThis video presents Professor \r\n   <a href=\"http&#58;//www.aku.edu/ismc/faculty/pages/profile.aspx?ProfileID=47&amp;Name=Jonas%20Otterbeck\" target=\"_blank\">Jonas Otterbeck\u200b</a>\u2019s research on popular culture and Islam. It argues for the need to understand and engage with Islamic-themed popular culture as so many Muslims do. The video features discussions with Professor Otterbeck and the photographer Peter Sanders, as well as music and videos from Poetic Pilgrimage, Mona Haydar, Maher Zain, Harris J and artwork and films from Marvel HQ, Al Jazzera, ID Mobile.\u200b\u200b\u200b<br></p><p><br></p>\r\n   <div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3 videoWP-border\">\r\n<iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"https&#58;//www.youtube.com/embed/P8qGJNlj-l0\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><br></div></div>",
